title: "pyR0compute: A Python library for automated symbolic computation of the basic reproduction number via the next-generation matrix"
authors:
  - family-names: Baldera-Moreno
    given-names: Yvan
    affiliation: "Universidad Católica del Maule, Chile"
version: 0.3.1
date-released: 2026-10-10
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yvan-BM-Git/pyR0compute"
